==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
[[File:Illu lymphatic system.jpg|thumb|Diagram of a female's lymphatic system.]]
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} In [[mammal]]s, including [[human]]s, a network of [[lymph vessel]]s and [[lymph node]]s that transport fluid, fats, [[protein]]s, and [[lymphocyte]]s to the [[bloodstream]] as [[lymph]], and remove [[microorganism]]s and other debris from tissues.

